 r←Test_Misc_041(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;json;config;msgs;dev
⍝ A cider.config using the new form ("tatin" plus "tatinTarget", "nuget" plus "nugetTarget") survives
⍝ being read, written and read again unchanged, and the dependency folders and target namespaces are
⍝ taken from it correctly, also when there is no "dependencies_dev" at all. Using both forms at once is
⍝ reported by `CheckDependencySettings`.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 tempDir←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 json←'{ CIDER: { dependencies: { tatin: "pkgs", tatinTarget: "Foo", nuget: "nupkgs", nugetTarget: "Goo.Hoo" },'
 json,←' dependencies_dev: { tatin: "pkgs_dev", tatinTarget: "" },'
 json,←' make: "", parent: "#", projectSpace: "Foo", source: "APLSource", tests: "" },'
 json,←' SYSVARS: { io: 1, ml: 1 } }'
 (⊂json)⎕NPUT tempDir,'/cider.config'

 config←##.Cider.ReadProjectConfig tempDir
 config ##.Cider.WriteProjectConfig tempDir
 config←##.Cider.ReadProjectConfig tempDir

 →T.GoToTidyUp('pkgs' 'Foo')≢config.CIDER.dependencies.(tatin tatinTarget)
 →T.GoToTidyUp('pkgs_dev' '')≢config.CIDER.dependencies_dev.(tatin tatinTarget)
 →T.GoToTidyUp('nupkgs' 'Goo.Hoo')≢config.CIDER.dependencies.(nuget nugetTarget)
 →T.GoToTidyUp('pkgs' 'Foo')('pkgs_dev' '')≢##.Cider.GetTatinDependencyFolders config
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,⊂'nupkgs' 'Goo.Hoo')≢##.Cider.GetNuGetDependencyFolders config
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠≢##.Cider.CheckDependencySettings config

⍝ No "dependencies_dev" at all
 dev←config.CIDER.dependencies_dev
 {}config.CIDER.⎕EX'dependencies_dev'
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,⊂'pkgs' 'Foo')≢##.Cider.GetTatinDependencyFolders config
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠≢'dependencies_dev'##.Cider.GetTatinDependencyFolders config
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠≢##.Cider.CheckDependencySettings config
 config.CIDER.dependencies_dev←dev

⍝ Both forms at once
 config.CIDER.dependencies.tatin←'pkgs=Foo'
 msgs←##.Cider.CheckDependencySettings config
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≢msgs
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'"dependencies.tatin"'⍷⊃msgs

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 FilesAndDirs.RmDir tempDir,'/..'
⍝Done
